# `**/` matters: a bare `node_modules`/`dist` only matches at the build
# context root, not services/*/node_modules or services/*/dist — a host
# checkout with those present (from local `npm ci`/`npm run build`) would
# otherwise leak into `COPY services/<svc> services/<svc>` and get compiled
# against/served as whatever happens to be on the developer's machine
# instead of what `npm ci`/`tsc`/`vite build` produce inside the image
# (see final-review fixes report, Important 2).
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dist-test
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.env
.superpowers
.mvp
docs
